manager improves play quite a bit.

The bug: Of course I went into the first shop I encountered, mmh 30 potions,
surely there must be that potion that enables me to outrun the shopkeeper.
Well I tried them all, and alas no go. Well, lets see how much I owe this
guy: Ix (inventory used up articles): nothing !!!!. This might turn out to
be a good day after all. Iu (inventory unpaid items) didn't show anything
either. However the shopkeeper must have been suspecting something, because
he refused to step aside. Well I thought lets try to bribe him with the
measly 32 gold I had. "You do not have enough money to buy the potion of
poison", so although he refuses to tell me how much I owe him, he still 
wants to rip me off. By sheer luck I did manage to escape the shop (They 
say that a wand of create monster can create a way out), and was 
reported to the kops for stealing a few grant. I didn't make it....

